# .env is Lovable-managed — tracked, public values only (Supabase project id/URL and
# the publishable/anon key, which are safe to ship client-side). Test credentials
# (TEST_EMAIL/TEST_PASSWORD) live in .env.e2e instead — never track that, or .env.local.
.env.e2e
.env.local
